OL,3,GNEWSAPeterhead engineering firm sold in
OL,4,A'#500m' private equity deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeterhead-based engineering company
OL,7,FScore Group has been sold in a deal
OL,8,Fbelieved to be one of the biggest ever
OL,9,Fprivate sales in the energy services
OL,10,Fsector.
OL,12,FLondon-based private equity firm
OL,13,FOrbeNovo Capital and the US-based
OL,14,FStellex Capital Management have agreed
OL,15,Fan undisclosed sum for the company,
OL,16,Fwhich employs more than 2,500 people in
OL,17,F30 locations across the world.
OL,19,FBBC Scotland News understands the deal
OL,20,Fis worth about #500m.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
